    "description": "The importer declares an enum of the same name as the library's (lib.esm) with a DIFFERENT value for `g_per_hp_hr` (7, where the library says 1). Enums are file-local (esm-spec §9.3): the imported template body keeps the library's 1, while the importer's own `enum` ops, including one it binds into the template's parameter, resolve against the importer's 7.",
    "name": "library_enum_importer_redeclares"
